{"id": "q0101", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "conservative", "tier": "conservative", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3720081385, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "1bd884090589f25ac8e99f9bb754f4b90b4c7a09d6887616d0aefbdba25a74d4", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.9057239890098572, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 4, "query": "Riproarin' Ringo was roping a recalcitrant dogie. Ringo decided to give the dogie a reprieve by calculating \\[|(1-i)^8|\\]before riding after the dogie. What answer should Ringo have found?\n\nSolve and give the final answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0101.wav", "input_sha256": "1ec9e7f5f9ada392c830d2d5b2f748a327a5dac43cbc6c5604f062faa0a5104d", "input_samples": 222000, "input_s": 13.875, "n_real_chunks": 14, "score": 0.4008, "act": 0.9976, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "1 i 8 means one times i to the eighth power. I is the square root of negative one, so let's see what happens when we raise it to different powers. If we start with i and multiply by itself, we get negative one. Then if we take that negative one and multi ply by i again, we get positive one. And then if we do it once more, we get back to i. So this pattern repeat s every four power s. That means i to the fourth power is one. Since eight is a multiple of four, i to the eighth power is just one times one, which is one. So Ringo should have found one.", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 14, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 37, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0101_conservative_local.wav", "sha256": "3bba22c6acecae7cf3de126024d789fffb07860e2fbc96e1fd57c7d0f0a53906", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 35.92}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.055, 1.101, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.056, 2.1, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.056, 3.102, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.057, 4.103, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.057, 5.102, 1, 0, 0], [5, 1, 6.0, 6.057, 6.104, 1, 0, 0], [6, 1, 7.0, 7.057, 7.102, 1, 0, 0], [7, 1, 8.0, 8.057, 8.103, 1, 0, 0], [8, 1, 9.0, 9.058, 9.104, 1, 0, 0], [9, 1, 10.0, 10.057, 10.101, 1, 0, 0], [10, 1, 11.0, 11.056, 11.101, 1, 0, 0], [11, 1, 12.0, 12.061, 12.108, 1, 0, 0], [12, 1, 13.0, 13.056, 13.1, 1, 0, 0], [13, 1, 13.875, 13.932, 13.977, 1, 0, 0], [14, 0, 14.875, 14.933, 15.07, 0, 0, 0], [15, 0, 15.875, 15.936, 16.39, 0, 24000, 0], [16, 0, 16.875, 16.933, 17.416, 0, 24000, 0], [17, 0, 17.875, 17.935, 18.444, 0, 24000, 0], [18, 0, 18.875, 18.932, 19.369, 0, 24000, 0], [19, 0, 19.875, 19.937, 20.46, 0, 24000, 0], [20, 0, 20.875, 20.934, 21.438, 0, 24000, 0], [21, 0, 21.875, 21.936, 22.46, 0, 24000, 0], [22, 0, 22.875, 22.937, 23.404, 0, 24000, 0], [23, 0, 23.875, 23.935, 24.464, 0, 24000, 0], [24, 0, 24.875, 24.934, 25.44, 0, 24000, 0], [25, 0, 25.875, 25.934, 26.416, 0, 24000, 0], [26, 0, 26.875, 26.935, 27.449, 0, 24000, 0], [27, 0, 27.875, 27.934, 28.505, 0, 24000, 0], [28, 0, 28.875, 28.935, 29.44, 0, 24000, 0], [29, 0, 29.875, 29.933, 30.46, 0, 24000, 0], [30, 0, 30.875, 30.936, 31.426, 0, 24000, 0], [31, 0, 31.875, 31.934, 32.487, 0, 24000, 0], [32, 0, 32.875, 32.933, 33.392, 0, 24000, 0], [33, 0, 33.875, 33.935, 34.422, 0, 24000, 0], [34, 0, 34.875, 34.934, 35.484, 0, 24000, 0], [35, 0, 35.875, 35.934, 36.489, 0, 24000, 0], [36, 0, 36.875, 36.935, 37.419, 0, 24000, 0], [37, 0, 37.875, 37.934, 38.419, 0, 24000, 0], [38, 0, 38.875, 38.936, 39.446, 0, 24000, 0], [39, 0, 39.875, 39.933, 40.435, 0, 24000, 0], [40, 0, 40.875, 40.933, 41.46, 0, 24000, 0], [41, 0, 41.875, 41.934, 42.418, 0, 24000, 0], [42, 0, 42.875, 42.934, 43.37, 0, 24000, 0], [43, 0, 43.875, 43.934, 44.466, 0, 24000, 0], [44, 0, 44.875, 44.937, 45.441, 0, 24000, 0], [45, 0, 45.875, 45.937, 46.4, 0, 24000, 0], [46, 0, 46.875, 46.935, 47.467, 0, 24000, 0], [47, 0, 47.875, 47.935, 48.444, 0, 24000, 0], [48, 0, 48.875, 48.934, 49.557, 0, 24000, 0], [49, 0, 49.875, 49.933, 50.397, 0, 24000, 0], [50, 0, 50.875, 50.934, 51.335, 0, 22080, 1]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 13.875, "last_real_feed_done": 13.932, "onset": 15.07, "gate_read_done": 15.07, "fire": null, "candidate_first_pcm": null, "stall_note": null, "stall_first_pcm": null, "local_first_pcm": 16.39, "wait_start": null, "expert_req": null, "expert_resp": null, "relay_synth_start": null, "relay_first_pcm": null, "relay_synth_end": null, "first_any_pcm": 16.39, "first_answer_pcm": 16.39, "session_end": 51.335}, "ttfa_answer_s": 2.515, "ttfa_any_s": 2.515}
{"id": "q0117", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "conservative", "tier": "conservative", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 767785885, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "1bd884090589f25ac8e99f9bb754f4b90b4c7a09d6887616d0aefbdba25a74d4", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.9057239890098572, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 4, "query": "Let $z = 2 + \\sqrt{2} - (3 + 3 \\sqrt{2})i$, and let $c = 2 - 3i$.  Let $w$ be the result when $z$ is rotated around $c$ by $\\frac{\\pi}{4}$ counter-clockwise.\n\n[asy]\nunitsize(0.6 cm);\n\npair C, W, Z;\n\nZ = (2 + sqrt(2), -3 - 3*sqrt(2));\nC = (2,-3);\nW = rotate(45,C)*(Z);\n\ndraw(Z--C--W);\n\ndot(\"$c$\", C, N);\ndot(\"$w$\", W, SE);\ndot(\"$z$\", Z, S);\nlabel(\"$\\frac{\\pi}{4}$\", C + (0.6,-1));\n[/asy]\n\nFind $w.$\n\nSolve and give the final answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0117.wav", "input_sha256": "a4ec9baee8bdbfc79d9150b0c10f81b383e91953897fdfc2f63c8d540224ffc9", "input_samples": 451600, "input_s": 28.225, "n_real_chunks": 29, "score": 0.7722, "act": 0.9969, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "To rotate a complex number z around another complex number c by an angle theta, we can use the formula w equals c plus e to the i theta times z minus c. So in this case, z is 2 plus square root 2 minus 3 plus 3 square root 2 i, c is 2 minus 3i, and the angle is pi over 4. Let's calculate z minus c first. That would be 2 plus square root 2 minus 3 plus 3 square root 2 i minus 2 plus 3i, which simpl ifies to square root 2 plus 3 square root 2 i plus 3 i. Next, we need to find e to the i times pi over 4, which is the same as co s pi over 4 plus i sine pi over 4, which is root 2 over 2 plus i root 2 over 2. Now, multiply that by z minus c. Let me do that step by step. Multi plying root 2 over 2 times square root 2 gives 1, and multi plying root 2 over 2 times 3 square root 2 i gives", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 28, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 60, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0117_conservative_local.wav", "sha256": "e2da862c7e89096fe5051e36cee3f3ff885b0e3a6249a6cfdf815e5ca1bc3e29", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 60.0}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.053, 1.095, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.055, 2.098, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.053, 3.095, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.055, 4.098, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.055, 5.098, 1, 0, 0], [5, 1, 6.0, 6.055, 6.098, 1, 0, 0], [6, 1, 7.0, 7.055, 7.099, 1, 0, 0], [7, 1, 8.0, 8.055, 8.098, 1, 0, 0], [8, 1, 9.0, 9.055, 9.101, 1, 0, 0], [9, 1, 10.0, 10.056, 10.101, 1, 0, 0], [10, 1, 11.0, 11.056, 11.1, 1, 0, 0], [11, 1, 12.0, 12.057, 12.101, 1, 0, 0], [12, 1, 13.0, 13.056, 13.1, 1, 0, 0], [13, 1, 14.0, 14.057, 14.102, 1, 0, 0], [14, 1, 15.0, 15.057, 15.102, 1, 0, 0], [15, 1, 16.0, 16.058, 16.103, 1, 0, 0], [16, 1, 17.0, 17.059, 17.103, 1, 0, 0], [17, 1, 18.0, 18.058, 18.104, 1, 0, 0], [18, 1, 19.0, 19.058, 19.102, 1, 0, 0], [19, 1, 20.0, 20.058, 20.102, 1, 0, 0], [20, 1, 21.0, 21.06, 21.104, 1, 0, 0], [21, 1, 22.0, 22.06, 22.106, 1, 0, 0], [22, 1, 23.0, 23.058, 23.102, 1, 0, 0], [23, 1, 24.0, 24.058, 24.102, 1, 0, 0], [24, 1, 25.0, 25.058, 25.104, 1, 0, 0], [25, 1, 26.0, 26.059, 26.103, 1, 0, 0], [26, 1, 27.0, 27.059, 27.103, 1, 0, 0], [27, 1, 28.0, 28.059, 28.105, 1, 0, 0], [28, 1, 28.225, 28.286, 28.743, 0, 24000, 0], [29, 0, 29.225, 29.283, 29.764, 0, 24000, 0], [30, 0, 30.225, 30.283, 30.774, 0, 24000, 0], [31, 0, 31.225, 31.283, 31.812, 0, 24000, 0], [32, 0, 32.225, 32.283, 32.787, 0, 24000, 0], [33, 0, 33.225, 33.285, 33.752, 0, 24000, 0], [34, 0, 34.225, 34.284, 34.717, 0, 24000, 0], [35, 0, 35.225, 35.286, 35.777, 0, 24000, 