{"id": "q0490", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "conservative", "tier": "conservative", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2109056733, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "1bd884090589f25ac8e99f9bb754f4b90b4c7a09d6887616d0aefbdba25a74d4", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.9057239890098572, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 4, "query": "制定可追溯性计划。", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0490.wav", "input_sha256": "1abf5a81e5e2683e04690d713116ffb37d7e0d5227ad8d8f36cdefa131f73aa8", "input_samples": 28800, "input_s": 1.8, "n_real_chunks": 2, "score": 0.4699, "act": 0.9818, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "制定可追溯性计划的第一步是明确目标。你需要确定想要追踪的具体信息和时间范围，比如产品来源或供应链流程。接下来，收集相关数据，包括生产日志、运输记录和供应商清单等。然后建立一个系统来管理这些数据，比如使用软件工具或数据库。确保所有相关人员都了解计划并参与其中。定期审核和更新数据以维持准确性。最后，考虑与合规和质量控制相关的要求，确保符合法规标准。这样可以有条不紊地推进整个过程。", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 40, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0490_conservative_local.wav", "sha256": "315130de11ef0d18ff691697915169bb2c7f07cfd2fea6deb2a3b7ba34318ccc", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 40.24}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.053, 1.095, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 1.8, 1.854, 1.896, 1, 0, 0], [2, 0, 2.8, 2.854, 2.897, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.8, 3.853, 4.148, 0, 24000, 0], [4, 0, 4.8, 4.855, 5.362, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 5.8, 5.855, 6.334, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.8, 6.858, 7.365, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.8, 7.855, 8.335, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.8, 8.855, 9.335, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.8, 9.857, 10.389, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.8, 10.856, 11.345, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 11.8, 11.856, 12.317, 0, 24000, 0], [12, 0, 12.8, 12.856, 13.3