{"id": "q0526", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "conservative", "tier": "conservative", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 1994436628, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "1bd884090589f25ac8e99f9bb754f4b90b4c7a09d6887616d0aefbdba25a74d4", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.9057239890098572, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 4, "query": "提出在交通领域减少碳排放的解决方案。", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0526.wav", "input_sha256": "ec15ad0632b764a9823d82f868dd7ebda73b58052ec2a5081db02723a627a205", "input_samples": 63200, "input_s": 3.95, "n_real_chunks": 4, "score": 0.1987, "act": 0.9984, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "在交通领域减少碳排放的方案，可以从几个方面来实施。首先推广清洁能源汽车，比如电动汽车和混合动力汽车，可以有效减少尾气排放。其次优化城市公共交通系统，比如增加地铁、公交和轻轨的覆盖范围和频率，鼓励人们少开车出行。另外推广绿色出行方式，比如骑自行车或步行，既环保又健康。还有就是提高燃油车辆的燃油效率标准，让车更省油。最后政府可以通过政策激励，比如提供购车补贴、建设充电设施等措施来推动这些改变。总之通过技术升级和制度引导，我们能显著降低交通领域的碳排放。", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 4, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 46, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0526_conservative_local.wav", "sha256": "58a364695dbcbbdc63384479bec18f78b9fb0ff89077f3fa603b4d14190412c8", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 45.96}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.052, 1.095, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.055, 2.099, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.056, 3.1, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 3.95, 4.004, 4.052, 1, 0, 0], [4, 0, 4.95, 5.006, 5.513, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 5.95, 6.006, 6.529, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.95, 7.007, 7.548, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.95, 8.005, 8.553, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.95, 9.006, 9.487, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.95, 10.007, 10.51, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.95, 11.007, 11.556, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 11.95, 12.008